      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns70UKcl",
      "title": "Update ENSC logo and description",
      "author": "moara-ops",
      "number": 1341,
      "body": "**Description**\r\nUpdates the existing ENSC entry (originally merged in #1223): refreshes the token logo and updates the description. No metadata or address changes — `name`, `symbol`, `decimals`, and both Lisk addresses are unchanged.\r\n\r\n- Symbol: ENSC · Decimals: 18 (unchanged)\r\n- Chains (unchanged): `lisk` (0xF50FFf154E63E510e494929E9eab1E9C5047429E), `lisk-sepolia` (0x6cdf5aDbB9e1673811A7a36540D79429045E7891)\r\n- `\"nobridge\": true` (unchanged)\r\n- New `logo.svg`: proper vector SVG, no base64, 300×300, ~99 KB\r\n\r\n**Tests**\r\nRan the repo's validator locally against this token and it passed cleanly:\r\n\r\nnpx tsx ./bin/cli.ts validate --datadir ./data --tokens ENSC\r\n# exit code: 0\r\n\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\nThis is a logo + description refresh only; the token folder still contains exactly two files (`data/ENSC/data.json`, `data/ENSC/logo.svg`) and no addresses were modified.\r\n\r\nPlease **approve running the validate workflow**, add the `lisk` label, and request review from @shuse2 (as on #1223). 🙏\r\n\r\n**Metadata**\r\nFollow-up to #1223",
